{"title":"Meetily Pro 0.1.12 Release Notes | Meetily","blocks":{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"section","id":"page-intro","children":[{"type":"h1","text":"Meetily Pro 0.1.12"},{"type":"p","text":"January 15, 2026"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"a","text":"Skip to main content","href":"#main"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"Release Highlights"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"January 15, 2026"}]}]},{"type":"p","text":"Windows stability fix and license management improvements"},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Fixed crashes on older Windows CPUs"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Trial extension for expired licenses"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Auto-enable meeting detection on activation"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"+"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Improved license management"}]}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"summary","text":"Table of Contents"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"h2","text":"What's New in Pro 0.1.12","id":"whats-new-in-pro-0112"},{"type":"p","text":"This release focuses on stability improvements for Windows users and makes license management smoother for everyone. We've fixed a crash that affected some Windows PCs and added helpful features for managing your Pro license."},{"type":"h3","text":"Windows Stability Fix","id":"windows-stability-fix"},{"type":"p","text":"Some Windows users were experiencing crashes when starting the app, particularly on older or budget CPUs. This was caused by the app trying to use advanced processor instructions (AVX-512) that aren't available on all computers. We've updated the app to work reliably across a wider range of Windows hardware, so you can use Meetily without worrying about compatibility."},{"type":"h3","text":"Trial Extension","id":"trial-extension"},{"type":"p","text":"If your trial has expired but you need a bit more time to evaluate Meetily Pro, you can now request an extension directly from the app. Simply click the extension option on the license screen, and we'll review your request. This makes it easier to fully explore all the Pro features before making a decision."},{"type":"h3","text":"Auto Meeting Detection","id":"auto-meeting-detection"},{"type":"p","text":"When you activate your Pro license, meeting detection now turns on automatically. This means you can start capturing meetings right away without needing to dig through settings. One less step between you and productive meetings."},{"type":"h3","text":"License Management Improvements","id":"license-management-improvements"},{"type":"p","text":"We've refined the license activation experience with better connectivity to our servers and a cleaner interface when your license needs attention. The app now provides clearer guidance when there are any issues with your license status."},{"type":"h2","text":"Download","id":"download"},{"type":"ul","children":[{"type":"li","text":"macOS (Apple Silicon): Download .dmg\n(opens in new tab)"},{"type":"li","text":"Windows: Download .exe\n(opens in new tab)"}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},{"type":"h3","text":"Ready to try Meetily?"},{"type":"p","text":"Join 599,000+ users who use Meetily for private meeting transcription. No bots, privacy first. Community Edition free."},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"No meeting bots"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"100% local transcription"}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Free & open source"}]}]},{"type":"div","children":[{"type":"a","text":"Downloa